/// The cube manifest itself (`CubeSpec`): a declarative sandbox profile
/// parsed from a strict yaml document.
///
/// ```yaml
/// apiVersion: fa/v1          # required, exactly 'fa/v1'
/// kind: Cube                 # required, exactly 'Cube'
